n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c replay **c\u0169** (client g\u1eedi l\u1ea1i version \u0111\u00e3 l\u1ed7i\\n\n     * th\u1eddi \u2192 412 STALE_VERSION). N\u00f3 kh\u00f4ng ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c replay **m\u1edbi**: client m\u1ea5t\\n\n     * response, t\u1ea3i l\u1ea1i phi\u1ebfu, th\u1ea5y version \u0111\u00e3 nh\u1ea3y 1 \u2192 2, t\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1ea7n qu\u00e9t tr\u01b0\u1edbc\\n\n     * tr\u01b0\u1ee3t n\u00ean g\u1eedi l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00fang h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u00f3 v\u1edbi version 2 h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7. Nh\u00e1nh c\u00f3 `item_id`\\n\n     * v\u1eabn an to\u00e0n nh\u1edd `assertNoDuplicateItemInDocument()`, nh\u01b0ng nh\u00e1nh COMPONENT\\n\n     * quantity-mode (kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 `item_id`) s\u1ebd c\u1ed9ng `scanned_qty` l\u1ea7n th\u1ee9 hai \u2014 \u0111\u00fang\\n\n     * defect reviewer x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u1edf DEV188-P1-03.\\n\n     *\\n\n     * C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng: `Idempotency-Key` **optional** (scan l\u00e0 stock-neutral, Annex C\\n\n     * kh\u00f4ng khai b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c n\u00ean kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c 428 khi thi\u1ebfu \u2014 c\u00f9ng quy \u01b0\u1edbc\\n\n     * {@see IdempotencyKeyGuard::optional()} \u0111ang d\u00f9ng cho Warranty), c\u1ed9ng v\u1edbi\\n\n     * fingerprint t\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh {@see ScanRequestFingerprint} l\u00e0m request hash:\\n\n     *\\n\n     * - c\u00f9ng key + c\u00f9ng n\u1ed9i dung scan  \u2192 replay \u0111\u00fang response c\u0169, `replayed=true`,\\n\n     *   `scanned_qty` KH\u00d4NG t\u0103ng l\u1ea7n hai (b\u1ea5t k\u1ec3 `If-Match` l\u00e0 version c\u0169 hay m\u1edbi);\\n\n     * - c\u00f9ng key + kh\u00e1c n\u1ed9i dung scan  \u2192 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT (SRS \u00a78.2);\\n\n     * - kh\u00e1c key + c\u00f9ng n\u1ed9i dung scan  \u2192 ch\u1ea1y b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng, c\u1ed9ng d\u1ed3n \u0111\u00fang nghi\u1ec7p v\u1ee5\\n\n     *   (hai l\u1ea7n qu\u00e9t th\u1eadt li\u00ean ti\u1ebfp c\u1ee7a c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t SKU/l\u00f4 v\u1eabn h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7);\\n\n     * - kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 key                    \u2192 gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean h\u00e0nh vi c\u0169, kh\u00f4ng ph\u00e1 client c\u0169.\\n\n     *\\n\n     * Fingerprint kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ee9a version v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ee9a m\u1ed1c th\u1eddi gian \u2014 kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng\\n\n     * time-window heuristic, \u0111\u00fang khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb c\u1ee7a reviewer.\\n\n     */\\n\n    public function inboundScan(Request $request, string $id)\\n\n    {\\n\n        $payload = $this->scanPayload($request);\\n\n        $expectedVersion = $this->expectedVersion($request);\\n\n        $idempotencyKey = IdempotencyKeyGuard::optional($request);\\n\n        $fingerprint = ScanRequestFingerprint::for('inbound_scan', $id, $payload);\\n\n\\n\n        [$code, $body, $replayed] = IdempotencyStore::handle(\\n\n            $idempotencyKey,\\n\n            'inbound_scan_'.$id,\\n\n            $this->actorId(),\\n\n            $fingerprint,\\n\n            function () use ($id, $payload, $expectedVersion): array {\\n\n                $result = $this->versionedScan($id, 'receipt', $payload, $expectedVersion);\\n\n\\n\n                return [200, $this->envelope('Inbound scan validated; stock_effect=NONE.', $result)];\\n\n            }\\n\n        );\\n\n\\n\n        // Gi\u1ed1ng post-receipt: QA ph\u1ea3i ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c replay \u1edf t\u1ea7ng body ch\u1ee9 kh\u00f4ng\\n\n        // ch\u1ec9 \u1edf header, v\u00ec proxy c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nu\u1ed1t header tu\u1ef3 bi\u1ebfn.\\n\n        if (is_array($body) && array_key_exists('data', $body) && is_array($body['data'])) {\\n\n            $body['data']['replayed'] = $replayed;\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        $response = response()->json($body, $code)\\n\n            ->header('Idempotent-Replay', $replayed ? 'true' : 'false');\\n\n\\n\n        $version = data_get($body, 'data.version');\\n\n        if ($version !== null) {\\n\n            $response->header('ETag', '\"'.((int) $version).'\"');\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        return $response;\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    // WWHN-195 / DEV195-P1-05R2 \u2014 \u0111\u00e3 g\u1ee1 `outboundScan()` c\u00f9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng in nh\u00e3n per-item\\n\n    // (`createAndDispatchLabel()` + `recordPrintResult()`) kh\u1ecfi controller n\u00e0y.\\n\n    //\\n\n    // Ch\u00fang hi\u1ec7n th\u1ef1c model nh\u00e3n c\u0169: m\u1ed7i item match sinh m\u1ed9t Label_Snapshot\\n\n    // PENDING_PRINT r\u1ed3i b\u1eafn l\u1ec7nh in ngay trong l\u00fac scan. SRS v1.12 \u00a75.2/\u00a76 ch\u1ed1t\\n\n    // ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i \u2014 scan kh\u00f4ng t\u1ea1o nh\u00e3n/l\u1ec7nh in; ch\u1ec9 khi full match m\u1edbi t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p \u0111\u00fang\\n\n    // 01 Packing Label DRAFT cho c\u1ea3 phi\u1ebfu r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi PREVIEWED \u2192 READY_TO_PRINT \u2192\\n\n    // PRINTED. Annex C: \"legacy per-Item-label operations = 0\".\\n\n    //\\n\n    // T\u1eeb 2026-08-15 kh\u00f4ng route n\u00e0o c\u00f2n tr\u1ecf t\u1edbi c\u00e1c method n\u00e0y (b\u1ecb\\n\n    // Flow06AlignmentServiceProvider override) nh\u01b0ng ch\u00fang v\u1eabn n\u1eb1m trong source, n\u00ean\\n\n    // WWHN-195-outbound-openapi.* v\u00e0 annotation Swagger \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb vi\u1ebft theo ch\u00fang. Xo\u00e1\\n\n    // t\u1ea1i g\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng ai d\u1ef1ng l\u1ea1i contract sai. Handler th\u1ef1c thi hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh:\\n\n    // AlignedOutboundFlowController::outboundScan().\\n\n\\n\n    /**\\n\n     * G\u1ee1 m\u1ed9t d\u00f2ng \u0111\u00e3 qu\u00e9t kh\u1ecfi phi\u1ebfu nh\u1eadp tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi Post.\\n\n     *\\n\n     * ERD b\u1ea3ng 28 inbound_scan_entries \u0111\u00e3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf s\u1eb5n status ACTIVE/REMOVED\\n\n     * (\"Cho s\u1eeda tr\u01b0\u1edbc Post\") c\u00f9ng removed_at/removed_by v\u00e0 index\\n\n     * idx_inbound_scan_line_status, nh\u01b0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 endpoint n\u00e0o d\u00f9ng n\u00ean\\n\n     * qu\u00e9t sai m\u1ed9t item ch\u1ec9 c\u00f2n c\u00e1ch Cancel c\u1ea3 phi\u1ebfu. Entry chuy\u1ec3n ACTIVE ->\\n\n     * REMOVED, line scanned_qty gi\u1ea3m t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng, ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n stock-neutral; item sau\\n\n     * \u0111\u00f3 qu\u00e9t l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u00e0o ch\u00ednh phi\u1ebfu n\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c phi\u1ebfu kh\u00e1c.\\n\n     */\\n\n    public function inboundUnscan(Request $request, string $id)\\n\n    {\\n\n        $payload = $request->validate([\\n\n            'inbound_scan_entry_id' => ['required', 'uuid'],\\n\n            'reason' => ['nullable', 'string', 'max:2000'],\\n\n        ]);\\n\n        $expectedVersion = $this->expectedVersion($request);\\n\n\\n\n        $result = DB::transaction(function () use ($id, $payload, $expectedVersion): array {\\n\n            $document = $this->lockDocument($id, 'receipt');\\n\n            $this->assertVersion($document, $expectedVersion);\\n\n            if (! in_array($document->status, ['DRAFT', 'SCANNING'], true)) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(409, 'STATE_CONFLICT', 'Ch\u1ec9 DRAFT/SCANNING m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ee1 m\u00e3 \u0111\u00e3 qu\u00e9t; sau Post ph\u1ea3i d\u00f9ng Reversal.');\\n\n            }\\n\n\\n\n            $entry = DB::table('inbound_scan_entries')\\n\n                ->where('id', $payload['inbound_scan_entry_id'])\\n\n                ->lockForUpdate()\\n\n                ->first();\\n\n            if ($entry === null) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(404, 'INBOUND_SCAN_ENTRY_NOT_FOUND', 'Kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y d\u00f2ng \u0111\u00e3 qu\u00e9t.');\\n\n            }\\n\n            $line = DB::table('stock_document_lines')\\n\n                ->where('id', $entry->inbound_line_id)\\n\n                ->where('stock_document_id', $id)\\n\n                ->lockForUpdate()\\n\n                ->first();\\n\n            if ($line === null) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(404, 'INBOUND_SCAN_ENTRY_NOT_FOUND', 'D\u00f2ng \u0111\u00e3 qu\u00e9t kh\u00f4ng thu\u1ed9c phi\u1ebfu nh\u1eadp n\u00e0y.');\\n\n            }\\n\n            if ((string) ($entry->status ?? 'ACTIVE') !== 'ACTIVE') {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(409, 'SCAN_ENTRY_NOT_ACTIVE', 'Ch\u1ec9 d\u00f2ng qu\u00e9t ACTIVE m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ee1 tr\u01b0\u1edbc Post.');\\n\n            }\\n\n\\n\n            $previousScanned = (int) $line->scanned_qty;\\n\n            $newScanned = max(0, $previousScanned - (int) $entry->quantity);\\n\n            DB::table('inbound_scan_entries')->where('id', $entry->id)->update([\\n\n                'status' => 'REMOVED',\\n\n                'removed_at' => now(),\\n\n                'removed_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n                'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n                'updated_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n            DB::table('stock_document_lines')->where('id', $line->id)->update([\\n\n                'scanned_qty' => $newScanned,\\n\n                'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n            $newVersion = $expectedVersion + 1;\\n\n            DB::table('stock_documents')->where('id', $id)->update([\\n\n                'version' => $newVersion,\\n\n                'updated_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n                'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n\\n\n            AuditLogger::record(\\n\n                action: 'INBOUND_UNSCAN',\\n\n                objectType: 'inbound_scan_entry',\\n\n                objectId: (string) $entry->id,\\n\n                actorId: $this->actorId(),\\n\n                requestId: request()?->attributes->get('request_id'),\\n\n                reason: $payload['reason'] ?? null,\\n\n                beforeData: ['status' => 'ACTIVE', 'scanned_qty' => $previousScanned],\\n\n                afterData: ['status' => 'REMOVED', 'scanned_qty' => $newScanned, 'item_id' => $entry->item_id],\\n\n            );\\n\n\\n\n            return [\\n\n                'document_id' => $id,\\n\n                'line_id' => (string) $line->id,\\n\n                'inbound_scan_entry_id' => (string) $entry->id,\\n\n                'item_id' => $entry->item_id !== null ? (string) $entry->item_id : null,\\n\n                'status' => 'REMOVED',\\n\n                'required_quantity' => (int) $line->qty_planned,\\n\n                'scanned_quantity' => $newScanned,\\n\n                'stock_effect' => 'NONE',\\n\n                'movement_created' => false,\\n\n                'version' => $newVersion,\\n\n            ];\\n\n        }, 3);\\n\n\\n\n        return $this->respondSuccess($result, 'Inbound scan entry removed; stock_effect=NONE.')\\n\n            ->header('ETag', '\"'.((int) $result['version']).'\"');\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    /**\\n\n     * G\u1ee1 m\u1ed9t item \u0111\u00e3 match kh\u1ecfi phi\u1ebfu xu\u1ea5t tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi Post (BR \"G\u1ee1 tr\u01b0\u1edbc Post\").\\n\n     * Match chuy\u1ec3n ACTIVE -> REMOVED, line scanned_qty gi\u1ea3m t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng; ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n\\n\n     * stock-neutral. Item sau \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 scan l\u1ea1i v\u00e0o phi\u1ebfu n\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c phi\u1ebfu kh\u00e1c.\\n\n     */\\n\n    public function outboundUnmatch(Request $request, string $id)\\n\n    {\\n\n        $payload = $request->validate([\\n\n            'outbound_item_match_id' => ['required', 'uuid'],\\n\n            'reason' => ['nullable', 'string', 'max:2000'],\\n\n        ]);\\n\n        $expectedVersion = $this->expectedVersion($request);\\n\n\\n\n        $result = DB::transaction(function () use ($id, $payload, $expectedVersion): array {\\n\n            $document = $this->lockDocument($id, 'issue');\\n\n            $this->assertVersion($document, $expectedVersion);\\n\n            if (! in_array($document->status, ['DRAFT', 'SCANNING'], true)) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(409, 'STATE_CONFLICT', 'Ch\u1ec9 DRAFT/SCANNING m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ee1 item \u0111\u00e3 match; sau Post ph\u1ea3i d\u00f9ng Reversal.');\\n\n            }\\n\n\\n\n            $match = DB::table('outbound_item_matches')\\n\n                ->where('id', $payload['outbound_item_match_id'])\\n\n                ->lockForUpdate()\\n\n                ->first();\\n\n            if ($match === null) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(404, 'OUTBOUND_MATCH_NOT_FOUND', 'Kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y item match.');\\n\n            }\\n\n            $line = DB::table('stock_document_lines')\\n\n                ->where('id', $match->outbound_line_id)\\n\n                ->where('stock_document_id', $id)\\n\n                ->lockForUpdate()\\n\n                ->first();\\n\n            if ($line === null) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(404, 'OUTBOUND_MATCH_NOT_FOUND', 'Match kh\u00f4ng thu\u1ed9c phi\u1ebfu xu\u1ea5t n\u00e0y.');\\n\n            }\\n\n            if ((string) ($match->status ?? 'ACTIVE') !== 'ACTIVE') {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(409, 'MATCH_NOT_ACTIVE', 'Ch\u1ec9 match ACTIVE m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ee1 tr\u01b0\u1edbc Post.');\\n\n            }\\n\n\\n\n            $previousScanned = (int) $line->scanned_qty;\\n\n            $newScanned = max(0, $previousScanned - (int) $match->quantity);\\n\n            DB::table('outbound_item_matches')->where('id', $match->id)->update([\\n\n                'status' => 'REMOVED',\\n\n                'removed_at' => now(),\\n\n                'removed_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n                'version' => ((int) ($match->version ?? 0)) + 1,\\n\n                'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n                'updated_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n            DB::table('stock_document_lines')->where('id', $line->id)->update([\\n\n                'scanned_qty' => $newScanned,\\n\n                'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n            $newVersion = $expectedVersion + 1;\\n\n            DB::table('stock_documents')->where('id', $id)->update([\\n\n                'version' => $newVersion,\\n\n                'updated_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n                'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n\\n\n            AuditLogger::record(\\n\n                action: 'OUTBOUND_UNMATCH',\\n\n                objectType: 'outbound_item_match',\\n\n                objectId: (string) $match->id,\\n\n                actorId: $this->actorId(),\\n\n                requestId: request()?->attributes->get('request_id'),\\n\n                reason: $payload['reason'] ?? null,\\n\n                beforeData: ['status' => 'ACTIVE', 'scanned_qty' => $previousScanned],\\n\n                afterData: ['status' => 'REMOVED', 'scanned_qty' => $newScanned, 'item_id' => $match->item_id],\\n\n            );\\n\n\\n\n            return [\\n\n                'document_id' => $id,\\n\n                'line_id' => (string) $line->id,\\n\n                'outbound_item_match_id' => (string) $match->id,\\n\n                'item_id' => $match->item_id !== null ? (string) $match->item_id : null,\\n\n                'status' => 'REMOVED',\\n\n                'required_quantity' => (int) $line->qty_planned,\\n\n                'scanned_quantity' => $newScanned,\\n\n                'stock_effect' => 'NONE',\\n\n                'movement_created' => false,\\n\n                'version' => $newVersion,\\n\n            ];\\n\n        }, 3);\\n\n\\n\n        return $this->respondSuccess($result, 'Outbound item match removed; stock_effect=NONE.')\\n\n            ->header('ETag', '\"'.((int) $result['version']).'\"');\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    public function postReceipt(Request $request, string $id)\\n\n    {\\n\n        return $this->postDocument($request, $id, 'receipt');\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    // `postIssue()` c\u0169ng \u0111\u00e3 g\u1ee1 c\u00f9ng l\u00fd do (DEV195-P1-05R2): route\\n\n    // POST /outbound-documents/{id}/post-issue tr\u1ecf th\u1eb3ng\\n\n    // AlignedOutboundFlowController::postIssue \u2014 n\u01a1i c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ee7 gate label PRINTED +\\n\n    // snapshot current + label-applied confirmation theo SRS \u00a75.2. Nh\u00e1nh\\n\n    // `$type === 'issue'` trong postDocument() \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i v\u00ec reverse('issue')\\n\n    // v\u1eabn d\u00f9ng chung h\u1ea1 t\u1ea7ng idempotency/version c\u1ee7a method n\u00e0y.\\n\n\\n\n    public function reverseInbound(Request $request, string $id)\\n\n    {\\n\n        return $this->reverse($request, $id, 'receipt');\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    public function reverseOutbound(Request $request, string $id)\\n\n    {\\n\n        return $this->reverse($request, $id, 'issue');\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function versionedScan(string $documentId, string $type, array $payload, int $expectedVersion): array\\n\n    {\\n\n        return DB::transaction(function () use ($documentId, $type, $payload, $expectedVersion): array {\\n\n            $document = $this->lockDocument($documentId, $type);\\n\n            $this->assertVersion($document, $expectedVersion);\\n\n            if (! in_array($document->status, ['DRAFT', 'SCANNING'], true)) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(409, 'STATE_CONFLICT', 'Ch\u1ec9 DRAFT/SCANNING m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c scan.');\\n\n            }\\n\n\\n\n            $line = DB::table('stock_document_lines')->where('id', $payload['line_id'])->where('stock_document_id', $documentId)->first();\\n\n            if ($line === null) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(404, 'DOCUMENT_LINE_NOT_FOUND', 'Kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y line trong document.');\\n\n            }\\n\n            $sku = DB::table('sku')->where('sku_id', $line->product_id)->first();\\n\n            if ($type === 'issue' && ($sku === null || strtoupper((string) $sku->sku_type) !== 'PRODUCT')) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(422, 'PRODUCT_SKU_REQUIRED', 'Outbound s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c scan COMPONENT; linh ki\u1ec7n ch\u1ec9 xu\u1ea5t qua Component Issue WARRANTY.');\\n\n            }\\n\n            if ($type === 'issue' && $document->outbound_request_id === null) {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(422, 'OUTBOUND_REQUEST_REQUIRED', 'Outbound ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c sinh t\u1eeb toa/request \u0111\u00e3 consume theo BP-WMS-04.');\\n\n            }\\n\n\\n\n            $resolvedItemId = $this->resolveItemId($payload);\\n\n            if ($resolvedItemId !== null) {\\n\n                $this->assertNoDuplicateItemInDocument($documentId, $type, $resolvedItemId);\\n\n            } elseif ($type === 'receipt') {\\n\n                $this->assertNoIdenticalBoxScanInDocument($documentId, (string) $line->id, $payload);\\n\n            }\\n\n\\n\n            $result = $this->stock->scanStockDocument($documentId, $type, $payload, $this->actorId());\\n\n            $newVersion = $expectedVersion + 1;\\n\n            DB::table('stock_documents')->where('id', $documentId)->update([\\n\n                'version' => $newVersion,\\n\n                'updated_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n                'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n            $this->attachScanEventToEvidence($documentId, $type, (string) $line->id, $result['item_id'] ?? null);\\n\n            $result['version'] = $newVersion;\\n\n\\n\n            return $result;\\n\n        }, 3);\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function postDocument(Request $request, string $id, string $type)\\n\n    {\\n\n        $expectedVersion = $this->expectedVersion($request);\\n\n        $key = IdempotencyKeyGuard::require($request);\\n\n        $hash = IdempotencyStore::requestHash($request);\\n\n        $operation = ($type === 'receipt' ? 'post_receipt_' : 'post_issue_').$id;\\n\n\\n\n        [$code, $body, $replay] = IdempotencyStore::handle(\\n\n            $key,\\n\n            $operation,\\n\n            $this->actorId(),\\n\n            $hash,\\n\n            function () use ($id, $type, $expectedVersion, $key, $hash): array {\\n\n                $result = DB::transaction(function () use ($id, $type, $expectedVersion, $key, $hash): array {\\n\n                    $document = $this->lockDocument($id, $type);\\n\n                    $this->assertVersion($document, $expectedVersion);\\n\n                    if ($document->status !== 'SCANNING') {\\n\n                        ApiError::abort(409, 'STATE_CONFLICT', 'Ch\u1ec9 SCANNING m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Post.');\\n\n                    }\\n\n                    if ($type === 'issue') {\\n\n                        if ($document->outbound_request_id === null) {\\n\n                            ApiError::abort(422, 'OUTBOUND_REQUEST_REQUIRED', 'Outbound ph\u1ea3i li\u00ean k\u1ebft toa/request ngu\u1ed3n.');\\n\n                        }\\n\n                        $this->assertLabelsPrinted($id);\\n\n                    }\\n\n\\n\n                    // Increment while document is still mutable. PostgreSQL protects a\\n\n                    // POSTED row from every later UPDATE, so the version bump must be\\n\n                    // part of the same outer transaction before the status becomes POSTED.\\n\n                    DB::table('stock_documents')->where('id', $id)->update([\\n\n                        'version' => $expectedVersion + 1,\\n\n                        'updated_by' => $this->actorId(),\\n\n                        'updated_at' => now(),\\n\n                    ]);\\n\n\\n\n                    $posted = $this->stock->postStockDocument($id, $type, $this->actorId(), $key, $hash);\\n\n                    $posted['version'] = $expectedVersion + 1;\\n\n\\n\n                    return $posted;\\n\n                }, 3);\\n\n\\n\n                return [200, $this->envelope($type === 'receipt' ? 'Post Receipt th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.' : 'Post Issue th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.', $result)];\\n\n            }\\n\n        );\\n\n\\n\n        // AC-GWT-IN-001 / TC-P1-005: retry c\u00f9ng Idempotency-Key tr\u1ea3 business result\\n\n        // c\u0169 k\u00e8m replayed=true \u2014 QA ph\u1ea3i ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c replay \u1edf t\u1ea7ng body, kh\u00f4ng\\n\n        // ch\u1ec9 \u1edf header.\\n\n        if (is_array($body) && array_key_exists('data', $body) && is_array($body['data'])) {\\n\n            $body['data']['replayed'] = $replay;\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        $response = response()->json($body, $code)->header('Idempotent-Replay', $replay ? 'true' : 'false');\\n\n        $version = data_get($body, 'data.version');\\n\n        if ($version !== null) {\\n\n            $response->header('ETag', '\"'.((int) $version).'\"');\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        return $response;\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function reverse(Request $request, string $id, string $type)\\n\n    {\\n\n        $payload = $request->validate([\\n\n            'reversal_document_id' => ['nullable', 'uuid'],\\n\n            'reason_code' => ['nullable', 'string', 'max:80'],\\n\n            'reason' => ['required_without:reversal_document_id', 'string', 'max:2000'],\\n\n            'condition_status' => [$type === 'issue' ? 'required_without:reversal_document_id' : 'nullable', 'in:SELLABLE,DEFECTIVE,NON_SELLABLE'],\\n\n            'physical_return_confirmed' => ['nullable', 'boolean'],\\n\n            'lines' => ['required_without:reversal_document_id', 'array', 'min:1'],\\n\n            'lines.*.movement_id' => ['required_with:lines', 'uuid'],\\n\n            'lines.*.quantity' => ['required_with:lines', 'integer', 'min:1'],\\n\n            'lines.*.item_id' => ['nullable', 'uuid', 'does not exist:item_instances,item_id'],\\n\n        ]);\\n\n        $expectedVersion = $this->expectedVersion($request);\\n\n        $key = IdempotencyKeyGuard::require($request);\\n\n        $hash = IdempotencyStore::requestHash($request);\\n\n        $operation = 'reverse_stock_document_'.$id.'_'.($payload['reversal_document_id'] ?? 'new');\\n\n\\n\n        [$code, $body, $replay] = IdempotencyStore::handle(\\n\n            $key,\\n\n            $operation,\\n\n            $this->actorId(),\\n\n            $hash,\\n\n            function () use ($id, $type, $payload, $key, $hash, $expectedVersion): array {\\n\n                $result = $this->reversal->execute($id, $type, $payload, $this->actorId(), $key, $hash, $expectedVersion);\\n\n\\n\n                return [200, $this->envelope('Reversal command processed; original document remains POSTED.', $result)];\\n\n            }\\n\n        );\\n\n\\n\n        // WWHN-234 F-09 / TC-P1-029: reversal replay c\u0169ng ph\u1ea3i l\u1ed9 \u1edf body.\\n\n        $body = IdempotentEnvelope::withReplayFlag($body, $replay);\\n\n\\n\n        return response()->json($body, $code)->header('Idempotent-Replay', $replay ? 'true' : 'false');\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function assertLabelsPrinted(string $documentId): void\\n\n    {\\n\n        $matches = DB::table('outbound_item_matches as m')\\n\n            ->join('stock_document_lines as l', 'l.id', '=', 'm.outbound_line_id')\\n\n            ->join('sku as s', 's.sku_id', '=', 'l.product_id')\\n\n            ->where('l.stock_document_id', $documentId)\\n\n            ->where('s.sku_type', 'PRODUCT')\\n\n            ->whereNotNull('m.item_id')\\n\n            ->where(function ($query): void {\\n\n                $query->whereNull('m.status')->orWhere('m.status', '!=', 'REMOVED');\\n\n            })\\n\n            ->get(['m.id', 'm.item_id']);\\n\n\\n\n        foreach ($matches as $match) {\\n\n            $status = DB::table('label_snapshots')->where('outbound_item_match_id', $match->id)->value('status');\\n\n            if ($status !== 'PRINTED') {\\n\n                ApiError::abort(422, 'LABEL_NOT_PRINTED', 'M\u1ecdi PRODUCT item ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 label PRINTED tr\u01b0\u1edbc Post Issue.', [\\n\n                    'item_id' => (string) $match->item_id,\\n\n                    'label_status' => $status,\\n\n                ]);\\n\n            }\\n\n        }\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    /**\\n\n     * WWHN-187 (DEV187-P1-07) \u2014 n\u1eeda c\u00f2n thi\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a invariant \"m\u1ed9t BOX thu\u1ed9c \u0111\u00fang m\u1ed9t\\n\n     * l\u1ea7n ghi nh\u1eadn\", cho nh\u00e1nh COMPONENT quantity-mode (kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 `item_id`).\\n\n     *\\n\n     * `assertNoDuplicateItemInDocument()` ch\u1ec9 b\u00e1m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u00e0o `item_id`, n\u00ean d\u00f2ng\\n\n     * COMPONENT quantity-mode kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 guard n\u00e0o \u1edf chi\u1ec1u **trong c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t phi\u1ebfu** \u2014\\n\n     * d\u00f9 `EnsureInboundComponentBox` \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1eb7n s\u1eb5n chi\u1ec1u **li\u00ean phi\u1ebfu**\\n\n     * (`BOX_IN_OTHER_ACTIVE_RECEIPT`). H\u1ec7 qu\u1ea3: m\u1ed9t request b\u1ecb g\u1eedi l\u1ea1i (m\u1ea5t response\\n\n     * r\u1ed3i refetch version m\u1edbi) \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi nh\u1eadn nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n qu\u00e9t th\u1eadt v\u00e0 `scanned_qty`\\n\n     * b\u1ecb c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u00f4i.\\n\n     *\\n\n     * `Idempotency-Key` (DEC-SCAN-IDEMP-001) \u0111\u00f3ng ca \u0111\u00f3 cho client **c\u00f3 g\u1eedi key**.\\n\n     * Guard n\u00e0y \u0111\u00f3ng ca client **kh\u00f4ng g\u1eedi key** \u2014 Postman, script QA, mobile ch\u01b0a\\n\n     * c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt \u0111\u1ec1u r\u01a1i v\u00e0o nh\u00f3m n\u00e0y \u2014 b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch bi\u1ebfn h\u1ecfng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u00e2m th\u1ea7m th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t\\n\n     * 409 n\u00f3i r\u00f5.\\n\n     *\\n\n     * C\u1ed1 \u00fd ch\u1ec9 ch\u1eb7n **tr\u00f9ng kh\u00edt tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i** (c\u00f9ng BOX + c\u00f9ng d\u00f2ng + c\u00f9ng s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng +\\n\n     * entry c\u00f2n ACTIVE), kh\u00f4ng ch\u1eb7n m\u1ecdi l\u1ea7n qu\u00e9t l\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t BOX:\\n\n     *  - nh\u1eadn c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t BOX l\u00e0m hai \u0111\u1ee3t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1c nhau (2 r\u1ed3i 3) v\u1eabn ch\u1ea1y \u2014 SRS\\n\n     *    \u00a71116 n\u00f3i r\u00f5 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng kh\u00f4ng l\u01b0u tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u1ea7y/v\u01a1i c\u1ee7a BOX n\u00ean kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c\\n\n     *    t\u1ef1 \u00e1p th\u00eam r\u00e0ng bu\u1ed9c \"m\u1ed9t BOX ch\u1ec9 qu\u00e9t m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n\";\\n\n     *  - \u0111\u00fang ch\u1eef k\u00fd c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n retry (y h\u1ec7t m\u1ecdi tr\u01b0\u1eddng) th\u00ec b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n.\\n\n     * L\u1ed1i tho\u00e1t khi thao t\u00e1c th\u1eadt s\u1ef1 c\u1ea7n l\u1eb7p: g\u1ee1 entry qua `POST /unscan` (ERD b\u1ea3ng\\n\n     * 28, ACTIVE \u2192 REMOVED) r\u1ed3i qu\u00e9t l\u1ea1i, ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd m\u1ed9t BOX kh\u00e1c.\\n\n     */\\n\n    private function assertNoIdenticalBoxScanInDocument(string $documentId, string $lineId, array $payload): void\\n\n    {\\n\n        $containerId = trim((string) ($payload['container_id'] ?? ''));\\n\n        if ($containerId === '') {\\n\n            return;\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        $duplicate = DB::table('inbound_scan_entries as e')\\n\n            ->join('stock_document_lines as l', 'l.id', '=', 'e.inbound_line_id')\\n\n            ->where('l.stock_document_id', $documentId)\\n\n            ->where('e.inbound_line_id', $lineId)\\n\n            ->where('e.container_id', $containerId)\\n\n            ->whereNull('e.item_id')\\n\n            ->where('e.quantity', (int) $payload['quantity'])\\n\n            ->where(function ($sub): void {\\n\n                $sub->whereNull('e.status')->orWhere('e.status', '!=', 'REMOVED');\\n\n            })\\n\n            ->exists();\\n\n\\n\n        if ($duplicate) {\\n\n            ApiError::abort(\\n\n                409,\\n\n                'DUPLICATE_BOX_SCAN_IN_LINE',\\n\n                'BOX n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u00f3 tr\u00ean d\u00f2ng nh\u1eadp n\u00e0y. N\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ea7n g\u1eedi l\u1ea1i, h\u00e3y d\u00f9ng l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00fang Idempotency-Key c\u0169; n\u1ebfu mu\u1ed1n ghi nh\u1eadn th\u00eam, h\u00e3y g\u1ee1 entry c\u0169 ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng BOX kh\u00e1c.',\\n\n                [\\n\n                    'line_id' => $lineId,\\n\n                    'container_id' => $containerId,\\n\n                    'quantity' => (int) $payload['quantity'],\\n\n                ]\\n\n            );\\n\n        }\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function assertNoDuplicateItemInDocument(string $documentId, string $type, string $itemId): void\\n\n    {\\n\n        $table = $type === 'receipt' ? 'inbound_scan_entries' : 'outbound_item_matches';\\n\n        $lineColumn = $type === 'receipt' ? 'inbound_line_id' : 'outbound_line_id';\\n\n        $query = DB::table(\"{$table} as e\")\\n\n            ->join('stock_document_lines as l', 'l.id', '=', \"e.{$lineColumn}\")\\n\n            ->where('l.stock_document_id', $documentId)\\n\n            ->where('e.item_id', $itemId)\\n\n            // Entry/match \u0111\u00e3 REMOVED (g\u1ee1 tr\u01b0\u1edbc Post) \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p qu\u00e9t l\u1ea1i v\u00e0o c\u00f9ng\\n\n            // phi\u1ebfu \u2014 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u1ea3 receipt (ERD b\u1ea3ng 28) v\u00e0 issue (ERD b\u1ea3ng 34).\\n\n            ->where(function ($sub): void {\\n\n                $sub->whereNull('e.status')->orWhere('e.status', '!=', 'REMOVED');\\n\n            });\\n\n        if ($query->exists()) {\\n\n            ApiError::abort(409, 'DUPLICATE_ITEM_IN_DOCUMENT', 'M\u1ed9t item ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c scan/match m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n trong c\u00f9ng document.');\\n\n        }\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function resolveItemId(array $payload): ?string\\n\n    {\\n\n        if (! empty($payload['item_id'])) {\\n\n            return (string) $payload['item_id'];\\n\n        }\\n\n        if (empty($payload['code_value'])) {\\n\n            return null;\\n\n        }\\n\n        $physical = DB::table('physical_codes')->where('code_value', strtoupper(trim((string) $payload['code_value'])))->where('status', 'ACTIVE')->first();\\n\n        if ($physical === null) {\\n\n            return null;\\n\n        }\\n\n        if (($physical->assigned_object_type ?? null) === 'ITEM' && ! empty($physical->assigned_object_id)) {\\n\n            return (string) $physical->assigned_object_id;\\n\n        }\\n\n        $itemId = DB::table('item_instances')->where('physical_code_id', $physical->physical_code_id)->value('item_id');\\n\n\\n\n        return $itemId ? (string) $itemId : null;\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function attachScanEventToEvidence(string $documentId, string $type, string $lineId, mixed $itemId): void\\n\n    {\\n\n        if (! DB::getSchemaBuilder()->hasColumn($type === 'receipt' ? 'inbound_scan_entries' : 'outbound_item_matches', 'scan_event_id')) {\\n\n            return;\\n\n        }\\n\n        $scanEventId = DB::table('scan_event as se')\\n\n            ->join('scan_batch as sb', 'sb.scan_batch_id', '=', 'se.scan_batch_id')\\n\n            ->where('sb.source_id', $documentId)\\n\n            ->when($itemId, fn ($query) => $query->where('se.resolved_object_id', $itemId))\\n\n            ->orderByDesc('se.created_at')\\n\n            ->value('se.scan_event_id');\\n\n        if ($scanEventId === null) {\\n\n            return;\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        $table = $type === 'receipt' ? 'inbound_scan_entries' : 'outbound_item_matches';\\n\n        $lineColumn = $type === 'receipt' ? 'inbound_line_id' : 'outbound_line_id';\\n\n        $row = DB::table($table)->where($lineColumn, $lineId)->when($itemId, fn ($query) => $query->where('item_id', $itemId))->orderByDesc('created_at')->first();\\n\n        if ($row !== null) {\\n\n            DB::table($table)->where('id', $row->id)->update(['scan_event_id' => $scanEventId]);\\n\n        }\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function scanPayload(Request $request): array\\n\n    {\\n\n        // Annex D SCR-IN-01 field `scan_input`: \"1..150 chars; trim\". Trim tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi\\n\n        // validate \u0111\u1ec3 chu\u1ed7i ch\u1ec9 g\u1ed3m kho\u1ea3ng tr\u1eafng b\u1ecb b\u1eaft l\u00e0 r\u1ed7ng thay v\u00ec l\u1ecdt xu\u1ed1ng\\n\n        // resolver, v\u00e0 ch\u1eb7n \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng 150 c\u1ee7a contract (tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 200).\\n\n        if ($request->has('code_value') && $request->input('code_value') !== null) {\\n\n            $request->merge(['code_value' => trim((string) $request->input('code_value'))]);\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        $validated = $request->validate([\\n\n            'line_id' => ['required', 'uuid'],\\n\n            'quantity' => ['required_without:qty', 'integer', 'min:1'],\\n\n            'qty' => ['required_without:quantity', 'integer', 'min:1'],\\n\n            'code_value' => ['nullable', 'string', 'min:1', 'max:150'],\\n\n            'item_id' => ['nullable', 'uuid'],\\n\n            'container_id' => ['nullable', 'uuid'],\\n\n            'printer_config_id' => ['nullable', 'uuid', 'does not exist:printer_configs,id'],\\n\n        ]);\\n\n        $validated['quantity'] = (int) ($request->input('quantity') ?? $request->input('qty'));\\n\n\\n\n        return $validated;\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function lockDocument(string $id, string $type): object\\n\n    {\\n\n        $document = DB::table('stock_documents')->where('id', $id)->where('doc_type', $type)->lockForUpdate()->first();\\n\n        if ($document === null) {\\n\n            ApiError::abort(404, 'RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND', 'Kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y stock document.');\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        return $document;\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function expectedVersion(Request $request): int\\n\n    {\\n\n        $header = trim((string) $request->header('If-Match'));\\n\n        if ($header === '') {\\n\n            ApiError::abort(428, 'PRECONDITION_REQUIRED', 'If-Match l\u00e0 b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c cho scan/post/reversal mutation.');\\n\n        }\\n\n        $header = preg_replace('/^W\\//', '', $header) ?? $header;\\n\n        $header = trim($header, '\" ');\\n\n        if (! ctype_digit($header)) {\\n\n            ApiError::abort(422, 'INVALID_VERSION', 'If-Match ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 version s\u1ed1 nguy\u00ean kh\u00f4ng \u00e2m.');\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        return (int) $header;\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function assertVersion(object $document, int $expected): void\\n\n    {\\n\n        if ((int) ($document->version ?? 0) !== $expected) {\\n\n            ApiError::abort(412, 'STALE_VERSION', 'Document version mismatch.', [\\n\n                'expected_version' => $expected,\\n\n                'current_version' => (int) ($document->version ?? 0),\\n\n            ]);\\n\n        }\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function envelope(string $message, array $data): array\\n\n    {\\n\n        return [\\n\n            'success' => true,\\n\n            'message' => $message,\\n\n            'data' => $data,\\n\n            'meta' => ['request_id' => request()?->attributes->get('request_id'), 'timestamp' => now()->toIso8601String()],\\n\n        ];\\n\n    }\\n\n\\n\n    private function actorId(): string\\n\n    {\\n\n        $id = auth('api')->id();\\n\n        if ($id === null) {\\n\n            ApiError::abort(401, 'UNAUTHENTICATED', 'Authentication required.');\\n\n        }\\n\n\\n\n        return (string) $id;\\n\n    }\\n\n}\\n\n' [UTF-8](length: 32624) contains \"createAndDispatchLabel\" [ASCII](length: 22)."},{"test":"Tests\\Feature\\Wwhn195OutboundContractAlignmentTest::test_scan_source_is_explicit_and_reaches_audit_evidence","file":"C:\\LAM_PHONG_TECH\\HoaNam_BE\\WMS_Warehouse_Hoa_Nam_BE\\tests\\Feature\\Wwhn195OutboundContractAlignmentTest.php","line":185,"message":"Kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y b\u1ea3ng evidence n\u00e0o mang c\u1ed9t scan_source."},{"test":"Tests\\Feature\\Wwhn195OutboundContractAlignmentTest::test_mode_is_per_scan_event_and_not_locked_to_the_document","file":"C:\\LAM_PHONG_TECH\\HoaNam_BE\\WMS_Warehouse_Hoa_Nam_BE\\tests\\Feature\\Wwhn195OutboundContractAlignmentTest.php","line":236,"message":"Kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y b\u1ea3ng evidence n\u00e0o mang c\u1ed9t scan_source."},{"test":"Tests\\Feature\\Wwhn198PackingLabelContractAlignmentTest::test_openapi_declares_the_batch_level_draft_label_behaviour","file":"C:\\LAM_PHONG_T